  "verbalization": "Mitomycin is linked to NCI-H1666 through a series of targets, all of which are modulated by palmarumycin CP18. The evidence suggests that mitomycin may act through palmarumycin CP18, which in turn targets NCI-H1666. This relationship is supported by the shared interaction between mitomycin and palmarumycin CP18, as well as the direct targeting of NCI-H1666 by palmarumycin CP18. The presence of multiple pathways involving palmarumycin CP18 indicates a potential mechanism where mitomycin influences the activity of palmarumycin CP18, which then affects NCI-H1666. The integration of these pathways highlights a possible regulatory or functional link between mitomycin and NCI-H1666, emphasizing the role of palmarumycin CP18 as a central mediator in this relationship.",
